{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":14,"voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural","engine":"edge","duration":292.68,"segs":[{"b":0,"part":0,"text":"The Supreme Lord said: I shall further explain to you that supreme knowledge, the best of all knowledge, knowing which all the sages have attained supreme perfection after this life. They who have taken refuge in this spiritual knowledge attain unity with Me and are neither born at the time of creation, nor afflicted at the time of dissolution.","start":0.0,"dur":19.032,"words":[[0.138,0.113,"The"],[0.263,0.45,"Supreme"],[0.725,0.25,"Lord"],[0.988,0.325,"said"],[1.6,0.075,"I"],[1.688,0.2,"shall"],[1.9,0.312,"further"],[2.225,0.438,"explain"],[2.675,0.113,"to"],[2.8,0.2,"you"],[3.013,0.175,"that"],[3.2,0.438,"supreme"],[3.65,0.463,"knowledge"],[4.362,0.1,"the"],[4.475,0.287,"best"],[4.775,0.1,"of"],[4.888,0.138,"all"],[5.037,0.475,"knowledge"],[5.787,0.312,"knowing"],[6.112,0.212,"which"],[6.338,0.175,"all"],[6.525,0.1,"the"],[6.638,0.45,"sages"],[7.1,0.113,"have"],[7.225,0.4,"attained"],[7.638,0.412,"supreme"],[8.062,0.613,"perfection"],[8.688,0.275,"after"],[8.975,0.188,"this"],[9.175,0.463,"life"],[10.037,0.2,"They"],[10.25,0.15,"who"],[10.412,0.15,"have"],[10.575,0.35,"taken"],[10.938,0.5,"refuge"],[11.45,0.113,"in"],[11.575,0.15,"this"],[11.738,0.55,"spiritual"],[12.3,0.412,"knowledge"],[12.725,0.362,"attain"],[13.1,0.4,"unity"],[13.512,0.188,"with"],[13.713,0.263,"Me"],[13.988,0.188,"and"],[14.188,0.05,"are"],[14.25,0.375,"neither"],[14.637,0.325,"born"],[14.975,0.087,"at"],[15.075,0.087,"the"],[15.175,0.275,"time"],[15.463,0.113,"of"],[15.588,0.613,"creation"],[16.512,0.2,"nor"],[16.725,0.55,"afflicted"],[17.288,0.087,"at"],[17.387,0.087,"the"],[17.488,0.3,"time"],[17.8,0.1,"of"],[17.913,0.75,"dissolution"]]},{"b":1,"part":0,"text":"Beings are born from the union of spirit and matter","start":19.032,"dur":3.504,"words":[[0.138,0.4,"Beings"],[0.55,0.075,"are"],[0.637,0.425,"born"],[1.075,0.188,"from"],[1.275,0.075,"the"],[1.363,0.45,"union"],[1.825,0.113,"of"],[1.95,0.537,"spirit"],[2.5,0.1,"and"],[2.612,0.512,"matter"]]},{"b":2,"part":0,"text":"My material Nature is the womb of creation wherein I place the seed of consciousness from which all beings are born, O Arjuna. Whatever forms are produced in all different wombs, O Arjuna, the material Nature is their body-giving mother; and I am the life-giving father.","start":22.536,"dur":16.344,"words":[[0.138,0.175,"My"],[0.325,0.575,"material"],[0.912,0.5,"Nature"],[1.425,0.175,"is"],[1.613,0.087,"the"],[1.712,0.3,"womb"],[2.025,0.125,"of"],[2.163,0.637,"creation"],[2.812,0.35,"wherein"],[3.175,0.087,"I"],[3.275,0.338,"place"],[3.625,0.1,"the"],[3.737,0.287,"seed"],[4.037,0.113,"of"],[4.162,0.688,"consciousness"],[4.862,0.163,"from"],[5.037,0.212,"which"],[5.263,0.188,"all"],[5.463,0.338,"beings"],[5.812,0.037,"are"],[5.862,0.425,"born"],[6.562,0.125,"O"],[6.7,0.6,"Arjuna"],[7.7,0.425,"Whatever"],[8.137,0.438,"forms"],[8.588,0.05,"are"],[8.65,0.525,"produced"],[9.188,0.138,"in"],[9.338,0.175,"all"],[9.525,0.375,"different"],[9.912,0.463,"wombs"],[10.613,0.113,"O"],[10.738,0.575,"Arjuna"],[11.588,0.075,"the"],[11.675,0.5,"material"],[12.188,0.475,"Nature"],[12.675,0.15,"is"],[12.838,0.113,"their"],[12.963,0.6,"body-giving"],[13.575,0.375,"mother"],[14.25,0.163,"and"],[14.425,0.087,"I"],[14.525,0.2,"am"],[14.738,0.087,"the"],[14.838,0.613,"life-giving"],[15.463,0.5,"father"]]},{"b":3,"part":0,"text":"How three modes of material nature bind us","start":38.88,"dur":3.336,"words":[[0.125,0.212,"How"],[0.35,0.275,"three"],[0.637,0.4,"modes"],[1.05,0.113,"of"],[1.175,0.562,"material"],[1.75,0.463,"nature"],[2.225,0.338,"bind"],[2.575,0.388,"us"]]},{"b":4,"part":0,"text":"Sattva or goodness; Rajas or passion, activity; and Tamas or ignorance, inertia — these three modes (Ropes, Gunas) of material Nature (Prakriti) fetter the eternal individual soul to the body, O Arjuna. Of these, the mode of goodness is illuminating and good because it is pure. It fetters the living entity by attachment to happiness and knowledge, O sinless Arjuna. Know that the mode of passion is characterized by intense craving and is the source of desire and attachment. It binds the living entity by attachment to the fruits of work. Know, O Arjuna, that the mode of ignorance — the deluder of living entity — is born of inertia. It binds the living entity by carelessness, laziness, and excessive sleep. O Arjuna, the mode of goodness attaches one to happiness (of learning and knowing the Eternal Being); the mode of passion attaches to intense action; and the mode of ignorance attaches to inaction, laziness by covering Self-knowledge.","start":42.216,"dur":60.576,"words":[[0.125,0.6,"Sattva"],[0.738,0.138,"or"],[0.887,0.6,"goodness"],[1.712,0.475,"Rajas"],[2.2,0.075,"or"],[2.288,0.55,"passion"],[3.025,0.662,"activity"],[3.962,0.113,"and"],[4.088,0.463,"Tamas"],[4.562,0.138,"or"],[4.713,0.588,"ignorance"],[5.575,0.55,"inertia"],[6.225,0.225,"these"],[6.463,0.237,"three"],[6.713,0.45,"modes"],[7.388,0.463,"Ropes"],[8.062,0.588,"Gunas"],[8.863,0.075,"of"],[8.95,0.525,"material"],[9.488,0.475,"Nature"],[10.188,0.613,"Prakriti"],[11.1,0.275,"fetter"],[11.387,0.1,"the"],[11.5,0.45,"eternal"],[11.963,0.512,"individual"],[12.488,0.338,"soul"],[12.838,0.087,"to"],[12.938,0.1,"the"],[13.05,0.388,"body"],[13.613,0.15,"O"],[13.775,0.588,"Arjuna"],[14.75,0.163,"Of"],[14.925,0.45,"these"],[15.637,0.087,"the"],[15.738,0.263,"mode"],[16.012,0.125,"of"],[16.15,0.5,"goodness"],[16.663,0.163,"is"],[16.837,0.838,"illuminating"],[17.688,0.15,"and"],[17.85,0.362,"good"],[18.225,0.275,"because"],[18.512,0.125,"it"],[18.65,0.138,"is"],[18.8,0.425,"pure"],[19.625,0.163,"It"],[19.8,0.438,"fetters"],[20.25,0.1,"the"],[20.363,0.338,"living"],[20.712,0.487,"entity"],[21.212,0.163,"by"],[21.387,0.725,"attachment"],[22.125,0.087,"to"],[22.225,0.525,"happiness"],[22.762,0.113,"and"],[22.887,0.45,"knowledge"],[23.637,0.087,"O"],[23.738,0.475,"sinless"],[24.225,0.575,"Arjuna"],[25.175,0.263